{"articleNo":"113932","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=113932&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 『한글자로 만나는 크리에이티브』-카피라이터 정철","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.09.15","hit":"13015","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2014 학부교육 선도대학 육성사업의 일환으로 독서를 통하여 전인적인 인성함양과 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">감성역량을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">강화하고, 책 읽는 캠퍼스 문화를 활성화 하기 위하여 카피라이터 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">정철의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">저자 강연회를 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">개최하오니, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"http://bit.ly/1D8R7aU\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><u>강연회 신청 클릭</u></strong></span></font></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p><u></u></p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 온라인 신청기간은 2014.9.22.(월)까지 입니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p></span><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/ee2e385c-d591-4562-826a-369138aac076.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;☎ 문의처 : 전자정보실 이병희 478-7173</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font size=